Subject: tu: keep UBWC on mutable images

Port the default behavior of Vauzi-17's Turnip-Z mutable-image change.
Keep the existing base-format, NV12 and R8G8/R16 layout restrictions.

Source: https://github.com/Vauzi-17/710/commit/a95571fa8a80968c79f2dbe8b13f224b6a1bf7c3

